WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.800
Usually in 10 monthly payments. If it is hard for you, you can ask for 12. The easiest way is to set up a «Direct Debit».

2
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:27.800
If you do not pay, you get a reminder giving you 7 days to catch up. If you do not, you can owe the whole year at once. The council can go to court (a liability order) and add costs to the debt.

3
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:41.500
After that, enforcement agents (bailiffs) may come, or deductions may be taken from your wages or benefits. If you fall behind, call the council straight away to agree a payment plan.

4
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:48.700
Now do the lesson exercises. If you are unsure, watch this video again.
